<title>USA: IPO FILING - HomeCom Communications Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - HomeCom Communications Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	    HomeCom Communications Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			HMCM.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $6-$7/shr</p>
<p>Common shares to be offered   1.25 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 1.25 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by shareholders  none</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    3,249,977</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Ladenburg, Thalmann &amp; Co Inc</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  187,500 shrs Business: Atlanta, Ga.,-based company develops and markets software applications and products enabling businesses to use Internet and Intranets to obtain and communicate business information.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: For general corporate purposes, principally additions to working capital, continued product development, repayment of debt and possible acquisitions in the future.</p>
<p>Financial Data:		1995		 1994</p>
<p>   - Revenue		 $327,574		n/a</p>
<p>   - Net Income (Loss)	5,440		n/a</p>
